# Issue #1315: a pass whose Setup() declares nothing while its command bucket
# is empty was cached empty, and gaining its first draw did not move the
# declaration key, so it stayed culled. Here the bucket-gated pass is the
# deferred forward overlay, which gains its first blended draw.
olo-state-machine-trace 1
seed 0
initial path=forward size=320x180 msaa=1 upscale=off features= blended=0 buffering=2 pose=0
op path deferred
op entity-churn add
op entity-churn remove
op entity-churn add
op path forward
op entity-churn remove
